+- A reached-callee failure before the callee is constructed becomes the caller's failed call-step result and the scope/run error; the selected callee frame and state stay untouched; ancestor frames persist ordinary failed step/current/visit/frame snapshots and promote the same diagnostic, unchanged, to the root. It is never wrapped in `call_failed`.
